  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Configurable toolbar actions, internal drag moves, file double-click behavior and bottom-button visibility across WinForms, Avalonia and WinUI. Changed defaults: core toolbar actions only, Open on file double-click in both dialog modes, and newest files first with sort indicators. Removes browser theme selectors/current-path footers and improves action icons. Enforces local transfer restrictions for drops; outgoing drag downloads are disabled when their final destination cannot be verified. Updated browser and Teamwork/Nextcloud sharing screenshots. Details: https://github.com/CompuMasterGmbH/CompuMaster.Dms/issues/165.",
